  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Harden validation-chain recognition, including split local binding, validation, and builder initializer statements; align BindNonPublicProperties receiver detection, constructor-bound inherited properties, ambiguous constructor rejection, optional constructor defaults, settable constructor-bound aliases, initialized get-only option property detection, type-level DataAnnotations, and dictionary recursive-validation guard coverage with runtime binding and validation; harden nested DataAnnotations and recursive-validation fixes, including constructor-bound record parameters and attribute-name conflicts; tighten appsettings discovery, colon-delimited key projection, ConfigurationKeyName matching, section typo literal preservation including raw newline fallback, generated-code suppression coverage, CI/publish formatting gates, and analyzer release tracking.",
